              "traits": "Match this exact Mewtwo source pose: pale humanoid body, distinct purple belly and long purple tail, horn-like head projections, focused eye, narrow neck and the source's individually separated fingers on both hands. Preserve the extended hand structure; do not make mitten-like hands."
            },
            "pokeapi:official-artwork:484": {
              "sha256": "c364c56bf8921cdb2e26922307379bc1d8b2f61220f366da467e117be26f33c9",
              "traits": "Match the exact white-and-pink Palkia source with its long neck, angular head crest, shoulder guards, purple round shoulder markings, chest plates, long tail and clearly separated finger claws on both hands. Keep the armored hands anatomically attached and source-shaped."
            },
            "pokeapi:official-artwork:909": {
              "sha256": "0308edd6c21008f2260916bdb4f2579ec11e89f2dac4196cf818105507f1dd0b",
              "traits": "Match the exact red Fuecoco source, its square yellow belly plate, black eye patches, yellow crest, friendly open mouth with a visible lower tooth, short legs and two separate scalloped hands. Do not flatten the lower tooth or make smooth mitten-like hands."
            }
